<title>USA: Aon completes  Martec acquisitions.</title>
<headline>Aon completes  Martec acquisitions.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aon Warranty Group, a unit of Aon Corp, said Tuesday it completed its acquisition of Martec Finance and Martec Australia, automotive industry consultants in the Australian and New Zealand markets.</p>
<p>Terms of the transactions were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Aon Warranty provides after-market products, consulting and administrative services to the automotive, consumer electronics and appliance industries.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
